<div class="hcm-or-hd"><span class="hcm-or-eyebrow">Best Bodyfriend Massage Chair by Buyer Type</span><h2>What Is the Best Bodyfriend Massage Chair for You?</h2></div>
<p style="margin-bottom:18px;max-width:760px">The <strong style="color:var(--ink)">best Bodyfriend massage chair</strong> depends on your body fit, comfort preference, space, and budget. A first-time premium buyer may prefer Falcon SV, while someone focused on lower-body movement may prefer Phantom Rovo. A design-focused buyer may compare Leonardo DV, while a no-compromise luxury buyer may look more closely at Pharaoh Q or Pharaoh Neo.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:30px;max-width:760px">The <strong style="color:var(--ink)">best Bodyfriend massage chairs</strong> should be judged by body fit, massage intensity, room size, feature priorities, and how the chair feels after several minutes of use — not by specs alone. Below is a starting framework. Always confirm the latest features and availability with the <a href="{{ shop.url }}/collections/bodyfriend" style="color:var(--gold);font-weight:700">best Bodyfriend massage chair for your needs</a> on the official product pages.</p>
