<section class="hcm-or-section" id="falcon-vs-phantom"><div class="hcm-or-wrap-sm">
<div class="hcm-or-hd"><span class="hcm-or-eyebrow">Falcon SV vs Phantom Rovo</span><h2>Bodyfriend Falcon SV vs Phantom Rovo: Which Model Should You Try First?</h2></div>
<p style="margin-bottom:18px">If you are comparing <strong style="color:var(--ink)">Bodyfriend Falcon SV vs Phantom Rovo</strong>, start with the difference in buyer fit. Falcon SV is the better starting point if you want a premium Bodyfriend chair with strong overall value. Phantom Rovo is the better starting point if lower-body movement, foot massager comfort, independent leg function, and massage intensity are your highest priorities.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:24px">For shoppers searching <strong style="color:var(--ink)">Bodyfriend Falcon vs Phantom Rovo</strong>, the decision should not be made only from the spec list. Try both chairs if possible. Pay attention to massage feel, leg stretch range, foot pressure, gravity positioning, control simplicity, and whether the chair fits your room.</p>
