<div class="hcm-or-pros"><h3>✓ Test in Person</h3>
<div class="hcm-or-pc"><div class="hcm-or-pc-dot g"></div><span><strong style="color:var(--ink)">Massage feel &amp; intensity</strong> — XD-Pro / XD massage layered pressure varies by model and your preference.</span></div>
<div class="hcm-or-pc"><div class="hcm-or-pc-dot g"></div><span><strong style="color:var(--ink)">Gravity recline &amp; positioning</strong> — How deep the recline goes and how supported you feel.</span></div>
<div class="hcm-or-pc"><div class="hcm-or-pc-dot g"></div><span><strong style="color:var(--ink)">Foot rollers &amp; calf airbags</strong> — Sole pressure and calf squeeze tested before purchase.</span></div>
<div class="hcm-or-pc"><div class="hcm-or-pc-dot g"></div><span><strong style="color:var(--ink)">Heat therapy zones</strong> — Lumbar, seat, and calf warmth — comfort-level, not medical-grade.</span></div>
